#: scenario7:scenario7_88E91C20_1FAC_4F1B_8BB7_CAF9D0FF2818
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b196712d7b8d7eca8543feb000f64127d878bbd2fc3ffcb05c1ab897a018abcd
#. default-sha256: 7267236666270667fdfea88a305b46db1f23aaecb134884e871d11c64775894a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_88E91C20_1FAC_4F1B_8BB7_CAF9D0FF2818"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫For so long, I have been waiting.⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫"
"Waiting for the day I would be rid of this darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Ho aspettato così a lungo,⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫il giorno "
"in cui mi sarei sbarazzata di queste tenebre."

