#: scenario7:scenario7_F26DF4E0_B5F5_4A9A_AADA_023B06F5F5DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a3d37b30fa6303cacd0997dedfd53c3ddc75e05b420b7a98c69b6bcdadf28e9
